# The repository root ignores `*.sqlite`, which is right for a working data directory and wrong
# here: the whole point of `fixtures/zotero/` is that the SQLite files are committed artefacts.
# A .gitignore deeper in the tree overrides a shallower one, so these two lines re-include them.
#
# The root pattern should probably be narrowed to `/data/*.sqlite` instead; that file is not ours
# to edit, so this negation stands in for it.
!*.sqlite
!*.sqlite-journal
